            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/15360288.2013.879247</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The European Society for Medical Oncology guidance on cancer pain management is described. Causes of pain form cancer management modalities, treatment of cancer-related pain, the role of pain management specialists in these patients' care, and the place of opioid pharmacotherapy and risks of opioid adverse events are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
